{"id":"vod_bf_37833","vodId":"37833","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"无职转生：到了异世界就拿出真本事","name_cn":"无职转生：到了异世界就拿出真本事","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-39/771e8a2ff63e706e3734b78a24413212.jpg"},"summary":"一场车祸夺走了34岁无业家里蹲男青年的生命，当他再度苏醒之后，震惊的发现自己竟然穿越到了异世界中，附身在了一位名为鲁迪乌斯（内山夕实 配音）的贵族少爷身上。面对这命运之神给予他的重新来过的机会，男子发誓这一世一定要拿出点真本事来认真的生活。然而，尽管鲁迪乌斯有着这般宏达的决心，但废柴大叔的本性却还是屡屡暴露。　　沉默寡言的三无魔法师洛琪希（小原好美 配音），个性软弱，因此想要学习魔法来自我保护的希露菲叶特（茅野爱衣 配音），个性暴躁但体能超强的艾莉丝（加隈亚衣 配音），和鲁迪乌斯一起在异世界里生活的，是这些可爱的女孩们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:52:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wuzhizhuanshengdaoliaoyishijiejiunachuzhenbenshi/第10集/index.m